%footer.foot
  .container.foot__in
    %section.foot__block
      %h2.foot__label Support
      %p
        RVM is maintained by community of volunteers, report issues to
        %a{ href: "https://github.com/rvm/rvm/issues" } RVM issues tracker.
        If you can help or wish to become one of the maintainers, just start helping.
        You can find more RVM related projects at
        %a{ href: "https://github.com/rvm" } RVM GitHub organization.
    %section.foot__block
      %h2.foot__label Donation
      %p
        Love RVM? Help us maintain RVM, a donation can help with it.
        Want to help in other way, want to be a sponsor? Contact
        %a{ href: "mailto:mpapis@gmail.com" } Michal Papis.
    %section.foot__block
      %h2.foot__label Sponsors
      %a.foot__sponsor{ href: "https://www.fastly.com/" }
        %img{ src: "/images/fastly_logo-01.png", alt: "Fastly", height: "40", width: "107", loading: "lazy" }
      .foot__ad
        %script#_carbonads_js{ async: "async", type: "text/javascript", src: "https://cdn.carbonads.com/carbon.js?zoneid=1673&serve=C6AILKT&placement=rvmio" }
    %p.foot__colophon
      &copy; 2009&ndash;2011
      %a{ href: "https://github.com/wayneeseguin" } Wayne E. Seguin,
      &copy; 2011&ndash;2017
      %a{ href: "https://github.com/mpapis" } Michal Papis,
      &copy; 2016&ndash;2017
      %a{ href: "https://github.com/pkuczynski" } Piotr Kuczynski.
      Built with
      %a{ href: "https://nanoc.app" } Nanoc,
      cached by
      %a{ href: "https://www.fastly.com/" } Fastly.

